I'm glad you sorted that out.
I can't think of any reason why not to use sex in hybrid mixture models across sessions. As you discovered, there's no carryover of information between sessions in 'secr' (and 'openCR' does not have hybrid mixture models), but this shouldn't be a problem.
Murray

